---
// Required public moderation disclaimer, word for word. Shown near every submission control and
// on the community guidelines page.
---

<div class="disclaimer" role="note" aria-label="Moderation policy">
  <p>
    Constructive feedback, questions, suggestions, and ideas are welcome. Disrespectful, abusive,
    harassing, or spam comments will be deleted without warning or discussion—no questions asked.
    Respectful criticism and bug reports are welcome. Submissions may be reviewed before they appear
    publicly.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .disclaimer {
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 55%, var(--line));
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 7%, var(--surface-2));
    border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    margin: var(--space-5) 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .disclaimer p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
  }
</style>
